Check if a String Is a Palindrome

Exercise:
Determine whether a string reads the same forwards and backwards.

Example:

Input:  "racecar"
Output: true
Input:  "hello"
Output: false


Solution:

let str = "he";
let l = 0;
let r = str.length - 1;
let isPalindome = true;

while (l < r) {
  if (str[l] !== str[r]) {
    isPalindome = false;
    break;
  }
  r--;
  l++;
}

console.log(isPalindome);
